				"The &eStorage Scanner&r indexes every inventory in a radius and gives you one searchable window across all of them."
				""
				"&e&lIt is not AE2, and that is the point.&r No cables, no channels, no controller, no cells. It reads chests, barrels, drawers and machine buffers exactly where they already are."
				""
				"&e&lIt still earns its place next to an ME network&r, because it sees the containers AE2 does not - machine inventories, unbussed drawers, the chest you dumped things in and forgot."
				""
				"&c&lKeep the scan radius tight.&r A large radius over a big base costs performance on every refresh."
				""
				"&7There is a handheld remote version that works from your inventory in range.&r"
