				""
				"Quarries that mine by shape card, a dimension you specified yourself, screens that read your whole base, logic without redstone dust, mobs from raw matter, and power that travels without cable."
				""
				"&7RFTools is the odd one out in this pack - it does not have a tech tree so much as a toolbox. Very little of it is required, and almost all of it is useful.&r"
